{"t0":2298,"t1":2658,"voice":0,"quoted":false,"pitch":0,"dist":0.000,"text":" I always figured when someone went crazy, started hearing voices, that sort of thing,","tokens":[314,1464,11638,618,2130,1816,7165,11,2067,4854,10839,11,326,3297,286,1517,11,51692]}
