{"t0":3662,"t1":3926,"voice":0,"quoted":false,"pitch":0,"dist":0.000,"text":" It's so detailed and realistic, even believable.","tokens":[632,338,523,6496,290,12653,11,772,41632,13,50841]}
{"t0":3926,"t1":4130,"voice":0,"quoted":false,"pitch":0,"dist":0.000,"text":" Who knew I had this much imagination in me?","tokens":[5338,2993,314,550,428,881,13843,287,502,30,50943]}
{"t0":4130,"t1":4470,"voice":0,"quoted":false,"pitch":0,"dist":0.000,"text":" Hell, I knew I should have started writing sci-fi a few years back.","tokens":[5783,11,314,2993,314,815,423,2067,3597,20681,12,12463,257,1178,812,736,13,51113]}
{"t0":4470,"t1":4788,"voice":0,"quoted":false,"pitch":0,"dist":0.000,"text":" I'd be raking in the cash by now.","tokens":[314,1549,307,374,868,287,262,5003,416,783,526,51277]}
{"t0":4798,"t1":5022,"voice":0,"quoted":false,"pitch":0,"dist":0.000,"text":" Perry hopped to a point right in front of me.","tokens":[14105,45230,284,257,966,826,287,2166,286,502,13,51389]}
{"t0":5022,"t1":5534,"voice":0,"quoted":true,"pitch":0,"dist":0.000,"text":" \"Van, I know this is hard for you to accept or even believe, but you're not imagining","tokens":[366,25298,11,314,760,428,318,1327,329,345,284,2453,393,772,1975,11,475,345,821,407,34140,51645]}
